A watchdog put back on the shell (rowt #s92): state remembers watch_impl=bash,
and an agent is installed, so `watch refresh` has something to rewrite. The
plist here is only a stand-in; refresh replaces it whole.

  watch refresh                   an upgrade's refresh, empty environment: the
                                  choice survives, the plist keeps ROWT_IMPL=bash
                                  — without it the agent would follow the front
                                  door's default, which is rowt-rs
